{"id": "Ugz5xqyDO4dXJjiA7Cd4AaABAg.AVwfEXX6ybkAW6HjEuhIzn", "parent": "Ugz5xqyDO4dXJjiA7Cd4AaABAg", "likes": 22, "text": "結局は壊滅と愉悦に狂わされたわけだしな……", "published": "2026-04-27T13:42:06", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
